{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tukoni: Forest Keepers is a cute &amp; cozy puzzle adventure, based on a series of award-winning books by the Ukrainian artist Oksana Bula. Play as the forest spirit Tukoni as you meet unique characters, solve captivating puzzles, brew fragrant tea and explore a magical world filled with kindness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933200/extras/75504fc3b48274a589444aa1af9d14ef.poster.avif?t=1771774787\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933200/extras/75504fc3b48274a589444aa1af9d14ef.webm?t=1771774787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933200/extras/75504fc3b48274a589444aa1af9d14ef.mp4?t=1771774787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breathtaking storybook aesthetic</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a magical hand-drawn forest world, inspired by the kind and nature-loving spirit of the world of Tukoni.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quest to help Autumn</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autumn is a busy time in the forest, as animals wrap up their matters before taking a winter nap, and forest keepers Tukoni hustle to prepare pillows and blankets of various shapes and forms. As for the main character, he\u2019s a Tukoni on a special mission. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast of whimsical characters</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of whimsical characters, each with their own unique quirks and endearing traits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging puzzles &amp; mini-games</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and get ready to be challenged to some captivating mini-games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933200/extras/475ecb727597629fecda688fcc391a98.poster.avif?t=1771774787\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933200/extras/475ecb727597629fecda688fcc391a98.webm?t=1771774787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933200/extras/475ecb727597629fecda688fcc391a98.mp4?t=1771774787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Notebook is your guide</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Notebook will offer guidance, help you solve puzzles, and document your adventures along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make fragrant tea</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the seasons change and the forest embraces the chill of autumn, take solace in the comforting ritual of brewing fragrant tea for your newfound friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wholesome adventure for all ages</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its charming visuals and engaging gameplay, Tukoni: Forest Keepers is a family-friendly experience that both parents and children can enjoy together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy up with Tukoni</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's a lazy afternoon or a chilly evening, Tukoni: Forest Keepers offers a cozy escape into a world of warmth and wonder, perfect for unwinding and embracing the simple joys of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://sha